  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/15/custom-background-hd.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"78\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">簡介</span></p>\n<p>此自訂主選單背景資源包最初是為我的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包所開發，現已獨立發布。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">詳細說明</span></p>\n<p>透過允許您將主選單背景更換為任何您喜愛的圖片，進一步提升原版遊戲體驗。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>只需下載此資源包並套用，即可擁有自訂的主選單背景。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如何更換背景</p>\n<p>- 從任何來源取得 PNG 截圖或高清圖片，並覆蓋壓縮檔內的以下檔案：<em>Custom Background HD.zip / assets / minecraft / textures / gui / title / background /&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">panorama_overlay.png</span></em></p>\n<p>- 請確保您的背景圖片重新命名為 'panorama_overlay.png'&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- 套用該資源包，即可享受自訂的主選單背景</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>圖片背景來源 -&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fillustrations%252ffire-and-water-hands-fight-fire-2354583%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/illustrations/fire-and-water-hands-fight-fire-2354583/</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/12/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/13/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/14/2023-11-16_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就購買伺服器，與朋友一起暢玩！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
